      "difference": "RFC6113 original permits implicit TGS armor; KILE extends computer explicit compound armor.",
      "resolution": "Use Windows compound derivation CF2(explicit_armor_key,user_subkey,\" explicitarmor\",\" tgsarmor\"); TGS checksum binds outer AP-REQ, not AS request-body."
    },
